{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce your way up  to the mysterious\u00a0<strong>Summit</strong>, where eternal pinball glory and an awesome gift await. This journey demands absolute mastery in the art of <strong>The Flipper</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE WARNED!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no typical pinball game. You must learn from every fall to  overcome this transformative challenge. Endure the climb and you may emerge a...\u00a0<strong>Pinball Wizard</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1750152630\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple, Accessible, One-Button Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You can play it with one finger!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hours of Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Try to beat it before the refund window is over!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Crafted Obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No AI or procedural generation here!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics Based Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>It really makes you <strong>feel</strong>\u00a0like a pinball!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Optional Checkpoints and Skipping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one will judge you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nearly-Endless Suffering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>At least the music is relaxing!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1750152630\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Developer Note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I was inspired by the momentum-based gameplay of &quot;Get To Work&quot; and the other legendary &quot;Foddian&quot; games that came before it. My goal was to provide a fresh take on the soul-testing magic I felt while playing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796230?t=1750152630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796230?t=1750152630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/42929941f82c98c1f587fede8caa8c4486cd94c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750152630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/42929941f82c98c1f587fede8caa8c4486cd94c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750152630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce your way up  to the mysterious\u00a0<strong>Summit</strong>, where eternal pinball glory and an awesome gift await. This journey demands absolute mastery in the art of <strong>The Flipper</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE WARNED!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no typical pinball game. You must learn from every fall to  overcome this transformative challenge. Endure the climb and you may emerge a...\u00a0<strong>Pinball Wizard</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1750152630\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple, Accessible, One-Button Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You can play it with one finger!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hours of Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Try to beat it before the refund window is over!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Crafted Obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No AI or procedural generation here!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics Based Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>It really makes you <strong>feel</strong>\u00a0like a pinball!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Optional Checkpoints and Skipping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one will judge you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nearly-Endless Suffering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>At least the music is relaxing!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1750152630\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Developer Note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I was inspired by the momentum-based gameplay of &quot;Get To Work&quot; and the other legendary &quot;Foddian&quot; games that came before it. My goal was to provide a fresh take on the soul-testing magic I felt while playing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Azimuth Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/dc5b90c1aa019c00eeedd18a0165bf3b9c17a167/header.jpg?t=1750152630","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152814,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152814/movie480.mp4?t=1749886163","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152814/movie_max.mp4?t=1749886163"},"name":"A Pinball Game That Ma